          "id": 787118261,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "So is there a set of CMake versions that have this problem?\n\nIf so, should CMakeLists.txt check, on Windows, for those versions, and fail with a message telling the user what versions they need?",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
