        {
          "id": 787227892,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I'm not sure. The issue appears to be a [thread race condition](https://gitlab.kitware.com/cmake/cmake/-/issues/22014) which should be fixed in 3.20.2. Our MR builder seems to be special enough (high system load? Docker?) to trigger it regularly, but I'm not sure about other systems.",
